        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off, only the sentence around the word is sent — to every source, one on this Mac included.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off, only the sentence around the word is sent — to every source, one on this Mac included."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭时只发送单词所在的句子；此规则适用于所有来源，包括这台 Mac 上的服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off, the Dock icon comes with a dictionary window and goes when the last one closes; with no window XDict waits in the menu bar, the shortcut, the Service and hover with it. Quit it from that icon.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off, the Dock icon comes with a dictionary window and goes when the last one closes; with no window XDict waits in the menu bar, the shortcut, the Service and hover with it. Quit it from that icon."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭时，程序坞图标随词典窗口出现，最后一个窗口关闭时消失；没有窗口时 XDict 留在菜单栏，快捷键、服务与悬停照常。请从菜单栏图标退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off, the log says how long a word was, never what it was. It never leaves this Mac unless you save it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off, the log says how long a word was, never what it was. It never leaves this Mac unless you save it."
          }
