        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭时，日志只记录词的长度，不记录词本身。除非你保存，日志不会离开这台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off. A three-finger tap does not look a word up.": {
