    },
    "Off. Turn it on to look up the word under the pointer: tap %@ twice with it resting on a word, in any app, with no BetterTouchTool.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off. Turn it on to look up the word under the pointer: tap %@ twice with it resting on a word, in any app, with no BetterTouchTool."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已关闭。开启后，把指针停在单词上连按两次 %@，即可在任意 App 中查询指针下的词，不需要其他工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On, choosing a question shows exactly what will be sent, with Send and Cancel, the first time a sentence is asked. Off, the question is asked when you choose it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On, choosing a question shows exactly what will be sent, with Send and Cancel, the first time a sentence is asked. Off, the question is asked when you choose it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开后，第一次就一句话提问时，会先显示将要发送的确切内容，并给出「发送」与「取消」。关闭时，选中问题即提问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On. Turn off Look Up & data detectors in Trackpad; Force Click is in the same pane.": {
