    "Select a word in any app and press the shortcut: its entry opens in a panel beside it. Press Escape or click elsewhere to close the panel, or the shortcut again to open it in XDict. You can also choose Look Up in XDict when you Control-click a selection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select a word in any app and press the shortcut: its entry opens in a panel beside it. Press Escape or click elsewhere to close the panel, or the shortcut again to open it in XDict. You can also choose Look Up in XDict when you Control-click a selection."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任意 App 中选中一个词并按下快捷键，词条会在它旁边的面板中打开。按 Esc 键或点按别处可关闭面板，再按一次快捷键则在 XDict 中打开。按住 Control 键点按所选内容时，也可以选取“在 XDict 中查询”。"
