            "value": "无法读取例句。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The explanation is written in this language. Quotes stay in the dictionary’s own language, and an edited prompt does not change this: the instruction is the app’s.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The explanation is written in this language. Quotes stay in the dictionary’s own language, and an edited prompt does not change this: the instruction is the app’s."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解释会用这种语言书写。引文保持词典原来的语言；修改提示词也不会改变这一点：这条指令由 XDict 添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The face Chinese words are drawn in; English keeps the reading style's own.": {
