            "value": "The prompt needs {term}, {sentence} and {entry}; {language} is optional and {sense} is not used here. A missing or unknown placeholder is refused before anything is sent. XDict appends the response format, which cannot be edited."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示词需要 {term}、{sentence} 和 {entry}；{language} 可选，此处不使用 {sense}。缺少或未知的占位符会在发送前被拒绝。XDict 会追加回复格式，该格式不可编辑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
