        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "XDict 在自己的配置中运行 Claude Code，与「终端」里的那份相互独立。要在那里登录，请在「终端」中运行下面的命令，并按提示登录："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "XDict — click for Reading History, right-click for the menu, press %@ to look up the selection": {
      "comment": "The menu bar icon's tooltip, naming both clicks and the registered lookup shortcut",
